    - :func:`jax.numpy.unique_values`: compute only ``values``.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.unique_inverse`: compute only ``values`` and ``inverse``.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.unique_all`: compute ``values``, ``indices``, ``inverse_indices``,
      and ``counts``.

